            "body": "I'm surprised that you only get this error message. There are a number of errors that `e_cdef_keywords_T241.pyx` tests for – but not this one. I'm not sure what the difference is in the case of calling a C++ class compared to a normal C function. That seems worth looking into. The other errors seem much more appropriate.\n\nWe definitely need a separate test file (as you created) for C++ calls due to the different compile mode.",
